			"notes": "- First Beta release of the standalone portal addon.\n- Carry Companion Cubes, refocusing cubes and mobs through portals without losing the grip.\n- Includes the live gun view/FOV editor, Realistic default, smooth Companion Cube and emissive materials.\n- Refreshed the module logo and resource-pack description in the same Beta.59 build.\n\nMinecraft **1.20.1** and **1.21.1**; universal JARs support Fabric, Forge and NeoForge. Fabric requires Fabric API. Install the matching [Justify API 2.0.0-beta.59](https://github.com/MrAskick/justifyapi/releases/tag/v2.0.0-beta.59) for your Minecraft version.\n\nBeta release; build numbering continues from alpha.58."
